# A 10-segment, 6-ring UV sphere of radius 1, centred on the origin.
# Deliberately carries no vn records: it is the fixture for the obj
# loader's generated normals, where box.obj can only show the crease
# threshold refusing to smooth. Poles are single shared vertices, so the
# top and bottom rings are triangle fans rather than quads.
#	                Vertices: 52
#	                   Faces: 100

o sphere

